0,Music of Belize - Wikipedia,https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Music_of_Belize,"Creole music culture is largely focused around political issues surrounding the Creole people of both Belize and the Caribbean. Stylistically, Creole music is widely known in Belize for its call-and-response structure, which requires at least two voices.",Belize English Creole,Creole
